<title>NETHERLANDS: CROWN VAN GELDER 1996 NET DOWN, DIV UP.</title>
<headline>CROWN VAN GELDER 1996 NET DOWN, DIV UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    21.70 vs  23.23</p>
<p>    Net profit			    20.8  vs  22.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		 10.00 vs   9.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			     257.0  vs 297.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Paper maker Crown van Gelder Papierfabrieken NV said</p>
<p>it was too early to give a forecast for the 1997 result, but</p>
<p>added the market showed good demand at the moment.</p>
<p>The company, which previously predicted profits would fall</p>
<p>in 1996, said the 1996 net had been favourably affected by about</p>
<p>two million guilders as a result of a change in accounting</p>
<p>principles.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
